(6523609, 966542, 73942, '<td valign="top">this is such a beautiful lighthouse and spot, you''ve got a lovely sky here as well and a bit of a reflection - all that equals a great photo - good luck</td>', 'this is such a beautiful lighthouse and spot, you''ve got a lovely sky here as well and a bit of a reflection - all that equals a great photo - good luck', '2011-09-01 17:01:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6523630, 970389, 59796, '<td valign="top">Wow! The subtle palette and the silhouette both work well in focusing us on what''s happening in the scene, rather than on any details. Fantastic story telling picture and an apt title.</td>', 'Wow! The subtle palette and the silhouette both work well in focusing us on what''s happening in the scene, rather than on any details. Fantastic story telling picture and an apt title.', '2011-09-01 17:19:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6523631, 970569, 59796, '<td valign="top">Surreal! Feels very old school - like a velvia scan! Simply love the reflection wrapping around the foreground and how the sky and the foreground rock balance each other out nicely in form. Wonderful composition. Among the nicest photos I''ve seen under harsh light, making use of it well.</td>', 'Surreal! Feels very old school - like a velvia scan! Simply love the reflection wrapping around the foreground and how the sky and the foreground rock balance each other out nicely in form. Wonderful composition. Among the nicest photos I''ve seen under harsh light, making use of it well.', '2011-09-01 17:19:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6523633, 970380, 59796, '<td valign="top">Wonderful bokeh and nice pastel palette. <br/>The harsh light on the purple flower and the cutoff wing take away from the scene though. Must''ve been hard to get one in such perfect focus - I know how fickle the moths are and how it''s always windy outdoors when you get to focus :) Good attempt.</td>', 'Wonderful bokeh and nice pastel palette. The harsh light on the purple flower and the cutoff wing take away from the scene though. Must''ve been hard to get one in such perfect focus - I know how fickle the moths are and how it''s always windy outdoors when you get to focus :) Good attempt.', '2011-09-01 17:22:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6523637, 970434, 59796, '<td valign="top">Interesting that the foreground matches the rainbow''s curve :) Nice composition there. The rainbow needs some boost in saturation though, to stand out more. Must''ve been a wonderful sight to behold.</td>', 'Interesting that the foreground matches the rainbow''s curve :) Nice composition there. The rainbow needs some boost in saturation though, to stand out more. Must''ve been a wonderful sight to behold.', '2011-09-01 17:25:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6523638, 970118, 59796, '<td valign="top">You don''t say! :)<br/>Very nice portrayal of idyllic country life! Always love the dutch windmills, and the sunny green and blue color combination. <br/>Funny that all the sheep are staring at the intruder :) "Go away and let us graze in peace!"</td>', 'You don''t say! :)Very nice portrayal of idyllic country life! Always love the dutch windmills, and the sunny green and blue color combination. Funny that all the sheep are staring at the intruder :) "Go away and let us graze in peace!"', '2011-09-01 17:28:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6523641, 966681, 59796, '<td valign="top">Not quite sure I get the title, but it doesn''t matter. The picture is so wonderful. The dappled light, the kids in the light path, the lone rock jutting out of the lake, the playful orientation, all add up to a nice picture. Converting to B/W is also a great idea to take the focus away from blown highlights.</td>', 'Not quite sure I get the title, but it doesn''t matter. The picture is so wonderful. The dappled light, the kids in the light path, the lone rock jutting out of the lake, the playful orientation, all add up to a nice picture. Converting to B/W is also a great idea to take the focus away from blown highlights.', '2011-09-01 17:31:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6523643, 968836, 59796, '<td valign="top">Wow! I don''t know where this is, but this is what I imagine Romania to be like.. :) Castle on a hill with wonderful country around... The teeny tiny road leading up into the hills, the village in the far distance, on the shore of a lake snaking in the background, the wonderful clouds pattern in the sky - so many elements to enjoy!</td>', 'Wow! I don''t know where this is, but this is what I imagine Romania to be like.. :) Castle on a hill with wonderful country around... The teeny tiny road leading up into the hills, the village in the far distance, on the shore of a lake snaking in the background, the wonderful clouds pattern in the sky - so many elements to enjoy!', '2011-09-01 17:37:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6523645, 969134, 59796, '<td valign="top">Very cool! Almost grunge. The clouds in the background look like an angry volcano! The B/W conversion makes us focus on the busyness and crowds rather than on the neons of the signs. Good idea!</td>', 'Very cool! Almost grunge. The clouds in the background look like an angry volcano! The B/W conversion makes us focus on the busyness and crowds rather than on the neons of the signs. Good idea!', '2011-09-01 17:38:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6523651, 968244, 59796, '<td valign="top">Whenever I see cascading falls, the picture I think of is this: <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=708843" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/902/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_708843.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/902/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_708843.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/902/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_708843.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>The falls are nicely framed in this one with a natural border all around.<br/>But the falls being busy only to a quarter of the picture leading out of the frame, leaves the rest of it quite empty of action and unable to support the main subject well. I don''t know how the terrain is and if you could get any closer, but filling up a majority of the frame with the cascading falls would''ve wowed me. Good luck.</td>', 'Whenever I see cascading falls, the picture I think of is this:   The falls are nicely framed in this one with a natural border all around.But the falls being busy only to a quarter of the picture leading out of the frame, leaves the rest of it quite empty of action and unable to support the main subject well. I don''t know how the terrain is and if you could get any closer, but filling up a majority of the frame with the cascading falls would''ve wowed me. Good luck.', '2011-09-01 17:46:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6523660, 969368, 59796, '<td valign="top">Beautiful lines! Love the composition as well - the square crop, the two leading line patterns, the harvester being where it is at the intersection. Wish the picture was underexposed a little - would have avoided the blown highlights on the harvester, as well as made the lines more prominent I think.</td>', 'Beautiful lines! Love the composition as well - the square crop, the two leading line patterns, the harvester being where it is at the intersection. Wish the picture was underexposed a little - would have avoided the blown highlights on the harvester, as well as made the lines more prominent I think.', '2011-09-01 17:48:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6523665, 970265, 59796, '<td valign="top">Woah! Beautiful color gradient in the sky, and wonderful silhouette of the Cypress. The subtle red palette on the ground moss, and extended exposure smoothening of the waves.... Wow! <br/>The border is ridiculous though - it''s almost on the verge of reducing the picture''s awesomeness - I sincerely wish you didn''t use a border or used one less bold/obtrusive.</td>', 'Woah! Beautiful color gradient in the sky, and wonderful silhouette of the Cypress. The subtle red palette on the ground moss, and extended exposure smoothening of the waves.... Wow! The border is ridiculous though - it''s almost on the verge of reducing the picture''s awesomeness - I sincerely wish you didn''t use a border or used one less bold/obtrusive.', '2011-09-01 17:53:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6523667, 965957, 59796, '<td valign="top">Such a wonderful scene at such a nice light. Good eye. I think the HDR is slightly overdone in this one though. Might''ve been better to merge a proper exposure of the sky to the rest of the pic. Just my opinion - I tend to be overly critical of HDRs :(</td>', 'Such a wonderful scene at such a nice light. Good eye. I think the HDR is slightly overdone in this one though. Might''ve been better to merge a proper exposure of the sky to the rest of the pic. Just my opinion - I tend to be overly critical of HDRs :(', '2011-09-01 17:57:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6523669, 970445, 59796, '<td valign="top">The picture''s oozing some pretty colors out! :)<br/>Delightful bokeh, lovely color palette, and spot on focus on a difficult subject outdoors. Amazingly crisp. Love the bug''s wings and the diagonal composition.</td>', 'The picture''s oozing some pretty colors out! :)Delightful bokeh, lovely color palette, and spot on focus on a difficult subject outdoors. Amazingly crisp. Love the bug''s wings and the diagonal composition.', '2011-09-01 18:00:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6523671, 970092, 59796, '<td valign="top">Woah! Beautiful composition and perfect exposure! Very angry and sinister clouds unleashing their master weapon! Delightful! Wish you''d used a border that''s less bold or no border at all on this one.</td>', 'Woah! Beautiful composition and perfect exposure! Very angry and sinister clouds unleashing their master weapon! Delightful! Wish you''d used a border that''s less bold or no border at all on this one.', '2011-09-01 18:01:49.000000', NULL, 1),
