(6523911, 970378, 59796, '<td valign="top">Love this! A very sensual picture with good color combination as well. Could use a better title though :P Also a square crop might look slightly better - I love the lighter blues, but the darker tones towards the right of the image aren''t as appealing to me as the rest of the pic.</td>', 'Love this! A very sensual picture with good color combination as well. Could use a better title though :P Also a square crop might look slightly better - I love the lighter blues, but the darker tones towards the right of the image aren''t as appealing to me as the rest of the pic.', '2011-09-01 20:22:31.000000', NULL, 1),
