(6523941, 970396, 92577, '<td valign="top">nice content and composition -  but the background is so sharp it''s competing with your model, why not soften it and then try adding a vignette?</td>', 'nice content and composition -  but the background is so sharp it''s competing with your model, why not soften it and then try adding a vignette?', '2011-09-01 20:55:55.000000', NULL, 1),
