(6523946, 970558, 59796, '<td valign="top">Delightful! The baby is shot in such wonderful soft light. And what a cute expression!! <br/> <br/>Wish everything except the baby and clothes were in Black &amp; White. Right now, the colors (especially on the rusted background) are slightly distracting. Also, there''s a hint of a second catchlight in the baby''s right eye that''s taking away from perfection. Almost there though - and I''m sure the baby''s parents are proud to have such wonderful portrait.<br/> <br/>I see that you were trying to combine Rust and Baby into the title, but I don''t think the end result has a positive connotation!</td>', 'Delightful! The baby is shot in such wonderful soft light. And what a cute expression!!  Wish everything except the baby and clothes were in Black & White. Right now, the colors (especially on the rusted background) are slightly distracting. Also, there''s a hint of a second catchlight in the baby''s right eye that''s taking away from perfection. Almost there though - and I''m sure the baby''s parents are proud to have such wonderful portrait. I see that you were trying to combine Rust and Baby into the title, but I don''t think the end result has a positive connotation!', '2011-09-01 21:02:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6523951, 970226, 59796, '<td valign="top">Hah! I can almost hear him say so :)<br/> <br/>Delightful dew drops, nice bokeh and a wonderful color palette. The subject does tend to get lost in the picture though (I understand that''s the intent of Mantis''s camouflage).</td>', 'Hah! I can almost hear him say so :) Delightful dew drops, nice bokeh and a wonderful color palette. The subject does tend to get lost in the picture though (I understand that''s the intent of Mantis''s camouflage).', '2011-09-01 21:04:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6523956, 969153, 59796, '<td valign="top">Feels like a heavy crop - the lack of details is hurting the picture quite a bit. Also, the focus is in the center of the pic with a busy background all around. Hope you''ll have a chance to shoot the beautiful bird again. Good luck!</td>', 'Feels like a heavy crop - the lack of details is hurting the picture quite a bit. Also, the focus is in the center of the pic with a busy background all around. Hope you''ll have a chance to shoot the beautiful bird again. Good luck!', '2011-09-01 21:07:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6523980, 969465, 59796, '<td valign="top">Wonderful detail and colors on the subject, and a nice unobtrusive background. Love the title, although I think it should be "Mostly Sunny" :)<br/>I do see quite a few jpeg/compression artifacts in the background though - possibly from post-processing?</td>', 'Wonderful detail and colors on the subject, and a nice unobtrusive background. Love the title, although I think it should be "Mostly Sunny" :)I do see quite a few jpeg/compression artifacts in the background though - possibly from post-processing?', '2011-09-01 21:22:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6523983, 966328, 59796, '<td valign="top">That is an alien landscape for sure.. Is that granite or sandstone? Wonderful striations and a nice, balanced composition. Wish that harsh shadow wasn''t there though - it''s distracting away from the direction of the striations..</td>', 'That is an alien landscape for sure.. Is that granite or sandstone? Wonderful striations and a nice, balanced composition. Wish that harsh shadow wasn''t there though - it''s distracting away from the direction of the striations..', '2011-09-01 21:24:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6523990, 969438, 59796, '<td valign="top">What a wonderful set of colors and reflections! Nicely done. <br/>The foreground is more or less a distraction, the rocks don''t have much detail or appeal to them, and are only serving as a block to the moon reflection. They''re not even needed as a natural border since you already have a bold border. Other than that, I think it''s a pretty neat composition even with the Moon in the center.</td>', 'What a wonderful set of colors and reflections! Nicely done. The foreground is more or less a distraction, the rocks don''t have much detail or appeal to them, and are only serving as a block to the moon reflection. They''re not even needed as a natural border since you already have a bold border. Other than that, I think it''s a pretty neat composition even with the Moon in the center.', '2011-09-01 21:27:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6523995, 966717, 59796, '<td valign="top">Talk about timing! Nice explosion in the hands. <br/>I think a closeup of the balloon splash without the model''s face would do even better (given that he''s already wearing a dark tee). I understand there''s much hard work involved in getting the timing right, not to mention the patience to clean up afterwards. However, DPCers might find such shots cliched - Good luck!</td>', 'Talk about timing! Nice explosion in the hands. I think a closeup of the balloon splash without the model''s face would do even better (given that he''s already wearing a dark tee). I understand there''s much hard work involved in getting the timing right, not to mention the patience to clean up afterwards. However, DPCers might find such shots cliched - Good luck!', '2011-09-01 21:33:20.000000', NULL, 1),
