(6524009, 969751, 59796, '<td valign="top">Nice timing on the collision of a drop and rebound. I know these things are hard, but DPC has an aversion to such drop shots as cliche. Especially in a Free Study - I hope you aren''t getting hammered. <br/> <br/>As an aside, DPC has also seen some extremely quality work in this aspect, so it''s hard to match up to that quality to score well. Here''s an example of a drop shot that''s done well in FS: <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=830224" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1104/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_830224.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1104/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_830224.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1104/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_830224.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>Good luck!</td>', 'Nice timing on the collision of a drop and rebound. I know these things are hard, but DPC has an aversion to such drop shots as cliche. Especially in a Free Study - I hope you aren''t getting hammered.  As an aside, DPC has also seen some extremely quality work in this aspect, so it''s hard to match up to that quality to score well. Here''s an example of a drop shot that''s done well in FS:   Good luck!', '2011-09-01 21:45:37.000000', NULL, 1),
