(6524025, 966166, 59796, '<td valign="top">ooh.. "Delicate" is right.<br/>Very sensual - from the subject to the color palette. Love the concept.<br/>However, there''s a certain lack of detail that''s bothering - either because it''s a huge crop or because of heavy noise reduction.</td>', 'ooh.. "Delicate" is right.Very sensual - from the subject to the color palette. Love the concept.However, there''s a certain lack of detail that''s bothering - either because it''s a huge crop or because of heavy noise reduction.', '2011-09-01 22:03:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6524026, 967836, 55838, '<td valign="top">I think I''d like this as a painting.  Lovely color tones  and composition.  I might have cropped a 1/2 inch from the left to cut out the hanging red thingy.  Very nice.</td>', 'I think I''d like this as a painting.  Lovely color tones  and composition.  I might have cropped a 1/2 inch from the left to cut out the hanging red thingy.  Very nice.', '2011-09-01 22:04:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6524031, 970538, 59796, '<td valign="top">Haha! I remember thinking about a similar shot when I first played the ''Angry birds'' seasons of the same title. But this is executed much better than I could''ve. Love it that the backdrop color matches her eyes. And the whole post-processing adds a wonderful ''technicolor'' feel to the shot. Nicely done.</td>', 'Haha! I remember thinking about a similar shot when I first played the ''Angry birds'' seasons of the same title. But this is executed much better than I could''ve. Love it that the backdrop color matches her eyes. And the whole post-processing adds a wonderful ''technicolor'' feel to the shot. Nicely done.', '2011-09-01 22:07:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6524035, 970124, 59796, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot! The vibrant tones on the boat are a nice contrast with muted tones everywhere else. The peeling paint on the boat, the clouds on the sky, the long exposure waves - all add such different textures to the melee. For such a subtle picture, the border is too bold and unnecessary though.</td>', 'Beautiful shot! The vibrant tones on the boat are a nice contrast with muted tones everywhere else. The peeling paint on the boat, the clouds on the sky, the long exposure waves - all add such different textures to the melee. For such a subtle picture, the border is too bold and unnecessary though.', '2011-09-01 22:11:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6524036, 969204, 59796, '<td valign="top">Beautiful evening sky. Always love that orange to blue color gradient. Nice shot of windmills at work. The set of converging lines into the far out distance is fantastic.</td>', 'Beautiful evening sky. Always love that orange to blue color gradient. Nice shot of windmills at work. The set of converging lines into the far out distance is fantastic.', '2011-09-01 22:14:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6524042, 966242, 59796, '<td valign="top">Seems like a nice shot - you should''ve posted at the full allowed resolution for 800px a side. I''m afraid, you might take a hammering in votes for the low resolution. Usually when I want to do it, it''s because I want to cover up some defect that''s apparent at a bigger resolution, in which case, I just chose to not submit it.<br/> <br/>The perfect black background is awesome and contrasts well with the subtle green and yellow of the flower. Good luck!</td>', 'Seems like a nice shot - you should''ve posted at the full allowed resolution for 800px a side. I''m afraid, you might take a hammering in votes for the low resolution. Usually when I want to do it, it''s because I want to cover up some defect that''s apparent at a bigger resolution, in which case, I just chose to not submit it. The perfect black background is awesome and contrasts well with the subtle green and yellow of the flower. Good luck!', '2011-09-01 22:18:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6524044, 969642, 59796, '<td valign="top">Ooh.. Lovely setting. The muted orange sky and the blue fog tones complement each other nicely. Those flying birds add even more charm to it. Love it.</td>', 'Ooh.. Lovely setting. The muted orange sky and the blue fog tones complement each other nicely. Those flying birds add even more charm to it. Love it.', '2011-09-01 22:19:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6524049, 970403, 59796, '<td valign="top">Southern hemisphere eh? :)<br/>Wonderful complementary orange and blue hues. Love the still rocks and their texture complementing the chaotic yet smooth water all around them. Nicely done.</td>', 'Southern hemisphere eh? :)Wonderful complementary orange and blue hues. Love the still rocks and their texture complementing the chaotic yet smooth water all around them. Nicely done.', '2011-09-01 22:21:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6524058, 970537, 59796, '<td valign="top">I think you should spell "Ever" as "Evvaaarr" :)<br/>Wonderful candid and a great idea converting to B/W. Captures the simple childhood pleasures very well. The tight crop is a good idea as well (must''ve been busy with a lot of folks in that area), but a little too tight on the right hand fingers :)</td>', 'I think you should spell "Ever" as "Evvaaarr" :)Wonderful candid and a great idea converting to B/W. Captures the simple childhood pleasures very well. The tight crop is a good idea as well (must''ve been busy with a lot of folks in that area), but a little too tight on the right hand fingers :)', '2011-09-01 22:29:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6524085, 970042, 57447, '<td valign="top">Hah hah, cute.</td>', 'Hah hah, cute.', '2011-09-01 23:15:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6524092, 969501, 119048, '<td valign="top">nice shot, I love it when no one else is around</td>', 'nice shot, I love it when no one else is around', '2011-09-01 23:25:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6524115, 969373, 115307, '<td valign="top">I think a portrait crop of just the leaves and the stone would have been even stronger. I find the right side of the image distracting. That being said, I love the simplicity of this shot and the contrast between the rock and leaves. Its always amazing when something so simple and common can make a great photograph.</td>', 'I think a portrait crop of just the leaves and the stone would have been even stronger. I find the right side of the image distracting. That being said, I love the simplicity of this shot and the contrast between the rock and leaves. Its always amazing when something so simple and common can make a great photograph.', '2011-09-01 23:43:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6524116, 970348, 69324, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition and I''m giving you a decent score but it''s  less than I''d of given you if you hadn''t of cropped the top of the hat off.  Very nice lighting and use of shallow DOF.</td>', 'Interesting composition and I''m giving you a decent score but it''s  less than I''d of given you if you hadn''t of cropped the top of the hat off.  Very nice lighting and use of shallow DOF.', '2011-09-01 23:44:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6524117, 969203, 115307, '<td valign="top">Wow, this is one of the greatest parrot portraits I have ever seen. The sharpness is just amazing. A 9 from me. I really love this.</td>', 'Wow, this is one of the greatest parrot portraits I have ever seen. The sharpness is just amazing. A 9 from me. I really love this.', '2011-09-01 23:44:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6524120, 968544, 115307, '<td valign="top">Is this that art display where statues of people stand in the water or did you set all of this up? Either way, this is fantastically photographed in every single way. The reaper adds drama, the silhouettes add drama, the lighting adds drama. Just everything is perfect in my opinion. A 10 and a fav from me. I hope you do well!</td>', 'Is this that art display where statues of people stand in the water or did you set all of this up? Either way, this is fantastically photographed in every single way. The reaper adds drama, the silhouettes add drama, the lighting adds drama. Just everything is perfect in my opinion. A 10 and a fav from me. I hope you do well!', '2011-09-01 23:47:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6524121, 968266, 50517, '<td valign="top">Superb 10!</td>', 'Superb 10!', '2011-09-01 23:47:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6524124, 969530, 50517, '<td valign="top">Awesome focus! fantastic job.  10!</td>', 'Awesome focus! fantastic job.  10!', '2011-09-01 23:49:10.000000', NULL, 1),
