(6524381, 970289, 108580, '<td valign="top">One lucky guy...judging by the wedding band. Perfect body and the golden smooth skin is well lit. I''m having trouble with the cropped right hand and chopped fingers left hand.</td>', 'One lucky guy...judging by the wedding band. Perfect body and the golden smooth skin is well lit. I''m having trouble with the cropped right hand and chopped fingers left hand.', '2011-09-02 02:32:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6524394, 970407, 114285, '<td valign="top">I see it but I don''t BELIEVE IT ! I''ve been waiting to say that for a long time on DP. THis is absolutely, absolutely, and absolutely one of those photos that should be in an art gallery so people can stare at it for a very, very,  very, long time, one of my all time favourite photos on DP. 10 for sure. Hope it ribbons for you. <br/>I can''t wait to see whose this is.</td>', 'I see it but I don''t BELIEVE IT ! I''ve been waiting to say that for a long time on DP. THis is absolutely, absolutely, and absolutely one of those photos that should be in an art gallery so people can stare at it for a very, very,  very, long time, one of my all time favourite photos on DP. 10 for sure. Hope it ribbons for you. I can''t wait to see whose this is.', '2011-09-02 02:39:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6524396, 970262, 114285, '<td valign="top">I''m a real sucker for romance, this is wonderful, a moment in time that will last forever in their heart. 9</td>', 'I''m a real sucker for romance, this is wonderful, a moment in time that will last forever in their heart. 9', '2011-09-02 02:40:26.000000', NULL, 1),
