(6524449, 970321, 114285, '<td valign="top">WOW  WOW WOW, I just love her dress, and the guy looks really handsome as well, gorgeous couple, may they have a wonderful future together. A picture to treasure forever. 10</td>', 'WOW  WOW WOW, I just love her dress, and the guy looks really handsome as well, gorgeous couple, may they have a wonderful future together. A picture to treasure forever. 10', '2011-09-02 03:26:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6524458, 970552, 108580, '<td valign="top">Now THAT is art in photography. And intriguing. Hope to see the photographers comment at rollover! It really is a clean and crisp shot without too much apparent PP. The door adds that oddity, the WTH aspect. <br/> <br/>(OK I got it.. sjhuls) Jennifer, in both entries, this and your previous entry the door <u>appears</u> off horizontal to the right by a few degrees. Could be more so at the top of the door sloping down to the right than in the middle and bottom of the door. It might have parallelogrammed over time? It feels off balance.</td>', 'Now THAT is art in photography. And intriguing. Hope to see the photographers comment at rollover! It really is a clean and crisp shot without too much apparent PP. The door adds that oddity, the WTH aspect.  (OK I got it.. sjhuls) Jennifer, in both entries, this and your previous entry the door appears off horizontal to the right by a few degrees. Could be more so at the top of the door sloping down to the right than in the middle and bottom of the door. It might have parallelogrammed over time? It feels off balance.', '2011-09-02 03:33:44.000000', NULL, 1),
