(6525124, 970552, 59796, '<td valign="top">Phew! A door with such nice textures and character, set in such a wonderful and incongruous setting - the possibilities are endless! I''m sure you''ll use this door again and again for various challenges. <br/> <br/>This particular shot hurts a little from the normal perspective. Probably a zoomed in shot from farther away might''ve enhanced the incongruity by blowing up the mountains size relative to the door. Good luck.</td>', 'Phew! A door with such nice textures and character, set in such a wonderful and incongruous setting - the possibilities are endless! I''m sure you''ll use this door again and again for various challenges.  This particular shot hurts a little from the normal perspective. Probably a zoomed in shot from farther away might''ve enhanced the incongruity by blowing up the mountains size relative to the door. Good luck.', '2011-09-02 15:55:19.000000', NULL, 1),
