(6525371, 969953, 59796, '<td valign="top">Such a wonderful shot, and the first thing I notice is that the horizon is tilted :( My loss for not being able to enjoy the beauty. The moody sky, the expansive foreground leading up to the nice and colorful building - pretty nice. The lamppost is nice on it''s own, but doesn''t quite gel into the picture well (makes it unbalanced).</td>', 'Such a wonderful shot, and the first thing I notice is that the horizon is tilted :( My loss for not being able to enjoy the beauty. The moody sky, the expansive foreground leading up to the nice and colorful building - pretty nice. The lamppost is nice on it''s own, but doesn''t quite gel into the picture well (makes it unbalanced).', '2011-09-02 17:57:31.000000', NULL, 1),
