(6525393, 966743, 59796, '<td valign="top">They''re all airborne at the same time and at roughly the same height :) Very good action shot! Very hard lighting conditions, and you did a very good job capturing the stopped motion. The noise in the dark sky is the only clue of a high ISO (as is some tiny loss of detail due to noise reduction).</td>', 'They''re all airborne at the same time and at roughly the same height :) Very good action shot! Very hard lighting conditions, and you did a very good job capturing the stopped motion. The noise in the dark sky is the only clue of a high ISO (as is some tiny loss of detail due to noise reduction).', '2011-09-02 18:18:09.000000', NULL, 1),
