(6525476, 967749, 59796, '<td valign="top">What a nice street shot.. Love the sepia tones, the different textures on the walls and the street, and the lone kid silhouette. Very good eye!<br/>The only thing bothering me is the aspect ratio - it''s not a square/portrait/landscape, and that''s immediately noticeable and distracting a little somehow. Maybe if you crop off the top half and make it a landscape it might work better? I can''t make up my mind, just something to think about. Good luck.</td>', 'What a nice street shot.. Love the sepia tones, the different textures on the walls and the street, and the lone kid silhouette. Very good eye!The only thing bothering me is the aspect ratio - it''s not a square/portrait/landscape, and that''s immediately noticeable and distracting a little somehow. Maybe if you crop off the top half and make it a landscape it might work better? I can''t make up my mind, just something to think about. Good luck.', '2011-09-02 19:36:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6525487, 969916, 59796, '<td valign="top">Beautiful! The good old strings of pearls... I''ve tried a couple of times to capture this but haven''t succeeded as well as this. Wouldn''t mind an even closer crop of the patterns. As it is, I would''ve loved to see it at the full allowable size of 800px.</td>', 'Beautiful! The good old strings of pearls... I''ve tried a couple of times to capture this but haven''t succeeded as well as this. Wouldn''t mind an even closer crop of the patterns. As it is, I would''ve loved to see it at the full allowable size of 800px.', '2011-09-02 19:41:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6525495, 970347, 59796, '<td valign="top">Love the minimalistic composition and beautiful complementary color combination. The aspect ratio is odd though - would''ve probably looked better in a portrait orientation rather than the squarish crop now.</td>', 'Love the minimalistic composition and beautiful complementary color combination. The aspect ratio is odd though - would''ve probably looked better in a portrait orientation rather than the squarish crop now.', '2011-09-02 19:45:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6525504, 969760, 59796, '<td valign="top">Very unique setting, and a nice HDR treatment. Not too keen on the all-red tones, but it does impart a mood to the scene. Nice starry effect on the lights - you must''ve stopped down the aperture quite a bit. I would''ve preferred a more landscape aspect ratio to balance out the left and right though - otherwise the asymmetric composition is noticeable.</td>', 'Very unique setting, and a nice HDR treatment. Not too keen on the all-red tones, but it does impart a mood to the scene. Nice starry effect on the lights - you must''ve stopped down the aperture quite a bit. I would''ve preferred a more landscape aspect ratio to balance out the left and right though - otherwise the asymmetric composition is noticeable.', '2011-09-02 19:53:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6525507, 970287, 59796, '<td valign="top">Wow! A sliver of peace and calm amidst turmoil above and below. Nicely done! Unique and different from the long exposure calmness sunrise shots.</td>', 'Wow! A sliver of peace and calm amidst turmoil above and below. Nicely done! Unique and different from the long exposure calmness sunrise shots.', '2011-09-02 19:54:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6525511, 970440, 59796, '<td valign="top">Have seen many of these and yet I''m impressed everytime. This one''s more colorful than most. Nicely done. <br/>Would''ve liked a symmetric composition and without the bold border, better.</td>', 'Have seen many of these and yet I''m impressed everytime. This one''s more colorful than most. Nicely done. Would''ve liked a symmetric composition and without the bold border, better.', '2011-09-02 19:56:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6525523, 966542, 59796, '<td valign="top">I vaguely remember seeing the same (or similar) scene before, but in Black &amp; White. With color, there are way too many things in the picture to focus on, all competing for attention. Individually, I love the separated reflection of the lighthouse, the texture on the rocks, and the beautiful color gradient in the sky.</td>', 'I vaguely remember seeing the same (or similar) scene before, but in Black & White. With color, there are way too many things in the picture to focus on, all competing for attention. Individually, I love the separated reflection of the lighthouse, the texture on the rocks, and the beautiful color gradient in the sky.', '2011-09-02 20:07:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6525533, 970537, 55838, '<td valign="top">Awesome - I love this!  What a great kid moment and your title could not be more perfect. 8</td>', 'Awesome - I love this!  What a great kid moment and your title could not be more perfect. 8', '2011-09-02 20:17:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6525536, 970504, 59796, '<td valign="top">The Sky is unreal! Wonderful lighting on the tree and birds too. Amazing. I would looooove to take a closer look at the topmost bird - the plumage is spread so magnificently - a close up of that alone might''ve got you into the top. Would''ve loved it had you used the full 800px allowed.</td>', 'The Sky is unreal! Wonderful lighting on the tree and birds too. Amazing. I would looooove to take a closer look at the topmost bird - the plumage is spread so magnificently - a close up of that alone might''ve got you into the top. Would''ve loved it had you used the full 800px allowed.', '2011-09-02 20:19:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6525538, 967895, 55838, '<td valign="top">I''m getting sleepy just counting them.  : )  Great detail and a lovely sky.</td>', 'I''m getting sleepy just counting them.  : )  Great detail and a lovely sky.', '2011-09-02 20:21:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6525542, 970422, 55838, '<td valign="top">What a fun shot!  Great color treatment and perspective. Adding to favorites. 8</td>', 'What a fun shot!  Great color treatment and perspective. Adding to favorites. 8', '2011-09-02 20:28:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6525544, 970321, 55838, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!  Great light, b&amp;w conversion and wonderful textures.  Very well done.  9</td>', 'Beautiful!  Great light, b&w conversion and wonderful textures.  Very well done.  9', '2011-09-02 20:32:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6525547, 970069, 55838, '<td valign="top">Great face with a very interesting expression.  Nice tones. 8</td>', 'Great face with a very interesting expression.  Nice tones. 8', '2011-09-02 20:39:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6525550, 970537, 115307, '<td valign="top">Wonderful moment captured, and lovely editing to boot! 8</td>', 'Wonderful moment captured, and lovely editing to boot! 8', '2011-09-02 20:41:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6525552, 970538, 115307, '<td valign="top">Quirky and fun :-)<br/>I like that her lipstick matches her shirt, and her eyes match the background.</td>', 'Quirky and fun :-)I like that her lipstick matches her shirt, and her eyes match the background.', '2011-09-02 20:49:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6525553, 970180, 115307, '<td valign="top">I love the bokeh and the editing here. Magical</td>', 'I love the bokeh and the editing here. Magical', '2011-09-02 20:53:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6525559, 970434, 115307, '<td valign="top">I hiked that just last month. By far my favorite hike in Yosemite. Nice capture of the rainbow, I wasn''t able to catch that when I was up there.</td>', 'I hiked that just last month. By far my favorite hike in Yosemite. Nice capture of the rainbow, I wasn''t able to catch that when I was up there.', '2011-09-02 21:02:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6525571, 969506, 96751, '<td valign="top">Lovely!</td>', 'Lovely!', '2011-09-02 21:08:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6525572, 967248, 96751, '<td valign="top">I feel like I''m looking at this through smoked glass</td>', 'I feel like I''m looking at this through smoked glass', '2011-09-02 21:09:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6525575, 969234, 96751, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait, although the vignetting would have worked better in the same tones as the image</td>', 'Nice portrait, although the vignetting would have worked better in the same tones as the image', '2011-09-02 21:09:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6525576, 970233, 96751, '<td valign="top">This is such an odd image.  Not a particularly pretty scene and yet I can''t stop looking at it.</td>', 'This is such an odd image.  Not a particularly pretty scene and yet I can''t stop looking at it.', '2011-09-02 21:10:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6525577, 970356, 96751, '<td valign="top">LOL!  Shot too soon - would have worked for 3 friends!</td>', 'LOL!  Shot too soon - would have worked for 3 friends!', '2011-09-02 21:10:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6525578, 970166, 96751, '<td valign="top">I love the shot, but feel the pp''ing missed the mark.  The colors are an interesting choice, but the skul is oddly dull and flat.</td>', 'I love the shot, but feel the pp''ing missed the mark.  The colors are an interesting choice, but the skul is oddly dull and flat.', '2011-09-02 21:11:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6525580, 970254, 96751, '<td valign="top">Marvelous!  What a great expression.</td>', 'Marvelous!  What a great expression.', '2011-09-02 21:11:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6525582, 969149, 96751, '<td valign="top">Never noticed the little red tips on their wings!  Great capture - gorgeous, subtle colors.</td>', 'Never noticed the little red tips on their wings!  Great capture - gorgeous, subtle colors.', '2011-09-02 21:12:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6525583, 969953, 96751, '<td valign="top">Looks lamost like a drawing.  Gorgeous light.  Nice HDR.</td>', 'Looks lamost like a drawing.  Gorgeous light.  Nice HDR.', '2011-09-02 21:12:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6525585, 970389, 96751, '<td valign="top">Looks like he''s standing on the water!  Beautiful colors.</td>', 'Looks like he''s standing on the water!  Beautiful colors.', '2011-09-02 21:12:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6525586, 969134, 58634, '<td valign="top">It certainly depicts what Times Square is like. I like the  bits and pieces of highlights throughout the image that make it almost silver like.</td>', 'It certainly depicts what Times Square is like. I like the  bits and pieces of highlights throughout the image that make it almost silver like.', '2011-09-02 21:13:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6525588, 970356, 58634, '<td valign="top">Cute portrait. Overall nice B&amp;W shirt except for the overblown shirt on the girl to the right. I''m also not too crazy about the thick black frame at the top and bottom.</td>', 'Cute portrait. Overall nice B&W shirt except for the overblown shirt on the girl to the right. I''m also not too crazy about the thick black frame at the top and bottom.', '2011-09-02 21:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6525589, 970449, 58634, '<td valign="top">I like the abstract sense in this, but the texture just doesn''t work for me.. I guess I just don''t get it.</td>', 'I like the abstract sense in this, but the texture just doesn''t work for me.. I guess I just don''t get it.', '2011-09-02 21:16:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6525590, 969234, 58634, '<td valign="top">Beautiful and timeles portrait.  I really love the way her hair shines in the light and I don''t even mind the fact that her elbow is cropped off. Gorgeous!</td>', 'Beautiful and timeles portrait.  I really love the way her hair shines in the light and I don''t even mind the fact that her elbow is cropped off. Gorgeous!', '2011-09-02 21:16:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6525592, 970260, 58634, '<td valign="top">If only this was dead set on the focus it would be awesome! Dogs are the silliest :)</td>', 'If only this was dead set on the focus it would be awesome! Dogs are the silliest :)', '2011-09-02 21:17:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6525594, 970243, 58634, '<td valign="top">I like the dark background because it really makes the pelicans stand out quite a bit.</td>', 'I like the dark background because it really makes the pelicans stand out quite a bit.', '2011-09-02 21:18:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6525595, 970307, 58634, '<td valign="top">Awesome shot! It''s definitely full of action and adventure.</td>', 'Awesome shot! It''s definitely full of action and adventure.', '2011-09-02 21:18:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6525647, 966607, 96751, '<td valign="top">There is something very sculptural about this</td>', 'There is something very sculptural about this', '2011-09-02 21:50:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6525649, 970118, 96751, '<td valign="top">I love sheep.  The tilt, not so much</td>', 'I love sheep.  The tilt, not so much', '2011-09-02 21:52:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6525650, 969134, 96751, '<td valign="top">Stunning!!!!</td>', 'Stunning!!!!', '2011-09-02 21:52:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6525652, 967977, 96751, '<td valign="top">Great portrait, but not a fan of desat.</td>', 'Great portrait, but not a fan of desat.', '2011-09-02 21:53:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6525662, 970289, 124982, '<td valign="top">Quite breathtaking. Beautiful lighting, maybe a touch too much smoothing on the skin though. Nonetheless, 8!</td>', 'Quite breathtaking. Beautiful lighting, maybe a touch too much smoothing on the skin though. Nonetheless, 8!', '2011-09-02 22:05:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6525663, 970412, 124982, '<td valign="top">This is outstanding. Just love the colors and lighting. Just perfectly processed! 9.</td>', 'This is outstanding. Just love the colors and lighting. Just perfectly processed! 9.', '2011-09-02 22:06:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6525664, 970071, 124982, '<td valign="top">Wonderfully captured! The lighting is just plain incredible!</td>', 'Wonderfully captured! The lighting is just plain incredible!', '2011-09-02 22:07:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6525665, 968724, 33672, '<td valign="top">Like something from Monet.. Very nice!</td>', 'Like something from Monet.. Very nice!', '2011-09-02 22:09:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6525667, 970487, 124982, '<td valign="top">Lovely turtle! Image would''ve been much better if the rocks/coral were cropped out.</td>', 'Lovely turtle! Image would''ve been much better if the rocks/coral were cropped out.', '2011-09-02 22:10:33.000000', NULL, 1),
