(6526248, 969351, 47470, '<td valign="top">This looks like it was taken on a cloudy day because the lighting is really flat.  I think adding a touch more contrast would have given this a huge boost.</td>', 'This looks like it was taken on a cloudy day because the lighting is really flat.  I think adding a touch more contrast would have given this a huge boost.', '2011-09-03 11:26:08.000000', NULL, 1),
