(6526252, 970275, 47470, '<td valign="top">Nice control of light for the high-key feel, but I think I would have preferred the tiniest bit more contrast to help the stamen stand out from the petals.</td>', 'Nice control of light for the high-key feel, but I think I would have preferred the tiniest bit more contrast to help the stamen stand out from the petals.', '2011-09-03 11:28:36.000000', NULL, 1),
