(6526263, 969944, 47470, '<td valign="top">Why did you choose green for the border?  It feels a bit jostling to me.  Cool scene, but I don''t think the border complements it at all.</td>', 'Why did you choose green for the border?  It feels a bit jostling to me.  Cool scene, but I don''t think the border complements it at all.', '2011-09-03 11:37:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6526269, 969135, 47470, '<td valign="top">If that face belonged to a human, it would belong to a crotchety old man with a hooked nose, but that''s a good thing because those kinds of faces are full of character and personality.  I love that this is a profile shot instead of straight on.  I think it''s the bird''s best angle : )  Nice texture.</td>', 'If that face belonged to a human, it would belong to a crotchety old man with a hooked nose, but that''s a good thing because those kinds of faces are full of character and personality.  I love that this is a profile shot instead of straight on.  I think it''s the bird''s best angle : )  Nice texture.', '2011-09-03 11:40:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6526272, 968918, 47470, '<td valign="top">I think the model and the clothing go very well with the scene to give a nice "Little House on the Prairie" feel.  I would have preferred a touch more contrast to bring up the lighter skin tones and the lighter bits of the sky.</td>', 'I think the model and the clothing go very well with the scene to give a nice "Little House on the Prairie" feel.  I would have preferred a touch more contrast to bring up the lighter skin tones and the lighter bits of the sky.', '2011-09-03 11:43:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6526281, 969312, 47470, '<td valign="top">This feels "muddy" to me (excuse the pun).  I would have preferred more contrast to help bring out the texture and the way the light plays off the wet ground.</td>', 'This feels "muddy" to me (excuse the pun).  I would have preferred more contrast to help bring out the texture and the way the light plays off the wet ground.', '2011-09-03 11:44:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6526282, 970387, 47470, '<td valign="top">I like the way the could on the horizon almost look like skyscrapers when you look at the foreground rocks.</td>', 'I like the way the could on the horizon almost look like skyscrapers when you look at the foreground rocks.', '2011-09-03 11:45:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6526290, 969473, 47470, '<td valign="top">When I look at this image, I don''t see anything about time.  I see turmoil, frenetic energy, and sludge-y looking water.  That''s why I don''t think your title is very strong or as fitting as it could have been.  I do like the detail and texture of the wave and all of the little drops that you captured so sharply.</td>', 'When I look at this image, I don''t see anything about time.  I see turmoil, frenetic energy, and sludge-y looking water.  That''s why I don''t think your title is very strong or as fitting as it could have been.  I do like the detail and texture of the wave and all of the little drops that you captured so sharply.', '2011-09-03 11:49:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6526302, 970566, 47470, '<td valign="top">The food there is so terrible, yet so good!  I wish you had included the people or some kind of reaction to the name.</td>', 'The food there is so terrible, yet so good!  I wish you had included the people or some kind of reaction to the name.', '2011-09-03 11:54:06.000000', NULL, 1),
