(6527061, 970519, 108580, '<td valign="top">Fabulous architecture shot, what drew me in was the silver B&amp;W processing and wisps but not violent and angry clouds. Just wondered why you cropped so tight in the highest point?</td>', 'Fabulous architecture shot, what drew me in was the silver B&W processing and wisps but not violent and angry clouds. Just wondered why you cropped so tight in the highest point?', '2011-09-04 09:13:11.000000', NULL, 1),
