(6527064, 969174, 108580, '<td valign="top">I''m guessing you''re getting a lot of views.<br/>Lovely study. Perfect lighting. Never mind the 10 form of your model, the tattoos and her face and lips are as important and visible as her stunning form. Front page material and hope the censor crew aren''t pounding you with 1''s. Only irritation are the two grey splotches to her left on the backdrop.</td>', 'I''m guessing you''re getting a lot of views.Lovely study. Perfect lighting. Never mind the 10 form of your model, the tattoos and her face and lips are as important and visible as her stunning form. Front page material and hope the censor crew aren''t pounding you with 1''s. Only irritation are the two grey splotches to her left on the backdrop.', '2011-09-04 09:14:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6527065, 968544, 108580, '<td valign="top">Fabulous concept image, shot, pose, lighting. I can''t wax lyrical about what I think you were trying to (or did) achieve. Walking dead? New arrivals in hell? The image will spark many of those. I like it with out having to decipher it.<br/>Should be front page.</td>', 'Fabulous concept image, shot, pose, lighting. I can''t wax lyrical about what I think you were trying to (or did) achieve. Walking dead? New arrivals in hell? The image will spark many of those. I like it with out having to decipher it.Should be front page.', '2011-09-04 09:14:54.000000', NULL, 1),
