(6527171, 969153, 28427, '<td valign="top">The title makes believe that the processing is intentionally. In a way it gives me the feeling that it was done to cover up a lack of focus.  Perhaps the original is far more focused then we would think.  Put in short: I don''t fancy the process that much and I think that a more subtle processing would have been better.  But of course this is only my personal opinion.</td>', 'The title makes believe that the processing is intentionally. In a way it gives me the feeling that it was done to cover up a lack of focus.  Perhaps the original is far more focused then we would think.  Put in short: I don''t fancy the process that much and I think that a more subtle processing would have been better.  But of course this is only my personal opinion.', '2011-09-04 10:20:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6527177, 970570, 28427, '<td valign="top">Don''t know what I''m looking at.  At first it looks like an exploding water balloon, but it isn''t - for sure. I''m curious to find out after the voting round what it is exactly.  Hope that the CN will tell me more.</td>', 'Don''t know what I''m looking at.  At first it looks like an exploding water balloon, but it isn''t - for sure. I''m curious to find out after the voting round what it is exactly.  Hope that the CN will tell me more.', '2011-09-04 10:23:35.000000', NULL, 1),
