(6527697, 970537, 58634, '<td valign="top">When I first opened the link to start voting on this challenge, this was the first image that stood out to me and I thought WOW! I''m glad I finally got to commenting on it... <br/> <br/>This definely exudes happiness and excitement. The gray tones are very even and well balanced; and the focus and sharpness are spot on. <br/> <br/>Great shot!</td>', 'When I first opened the link to start voting on this challenge, this was the first image that stood out to me and I thought WOW! I''m glad I finally got to commenting on it...  This definely exudes happiness and excitement. The gray tones are very even and well balanced; and the focus and sharpness are spot on.  Great shot!', '2011-09-04 18:36:55.000000', NULL, 1),
