(6529573, 966607, 96664, '<td valign="top">As for scoring goes... This will probably bomb. I love it though. It made me stop and think. Something that a lot of these photos have yet to do. Well done. Good usage of grain. Will be back to vote later. :)<br/> <br/>Came back to favorite. Well done. This is my favorite of the challenge. :)</td>', 'As for scoring goes... This will probably bomb. I love it though. It made me stop and think. Something that a lot of these photos have yet to do. Well done. Good usage of grain. Will be back to vote later. :) Came back to favorite. Well done. This is my favorite of the challenge. :)', '2011-09-05 22:06:05.000000', NULL, 1),
