(6530258, 967248, 83313, '<td valign="top">Watch your compression. I can see obvious artifacts and pixelation near the lamp posts on the bridge. At a file size of 58k, you used way more compression than needed and the clarity of the image has suffered from it.  You had plenty of overhead to spare. Always use the least compression you can and still fit within the challenge limit of 300k.</td>', 'Watch your compression. I can see obvious artifacts and pixelation near the lamp posts on the bridge. At a file size of 58k, you used way more compression than needed and the clarity of the image has suffered from it.  You had plenty of overhead to spare. Always use the least compression you can and still fit within the challenge limit of 300k.', '2011-09-06 14:21:14.000000', NULL, 1),
