(6531417, 969596, 59737, '<td valign="top">great exposures and color on this, would have been good in the sun in frame and even flare challenge.  Very nicely done.</td>', 'great exposures and color on this, would have been good in the sun in frame and even flare challenge.  Very nicely done.', '2011-09-07 10:09:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6531418, 968904, 59737, '<td valign="top">The group is having some fun, nice vacation type shot.  The dunes look fun and inviting.</td>', 'The group is having some fun, nice vacation type shot.  The dunes look fun and inviting.', '2011-09-07 10:10:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6531420, 970005, 59737, '<td valign="top">Nicely done like the details and processing on this.  Shows that an image doesn''t have to be complex and colorful to be a strong image.</td>', 'Nicely done like the details and processing on this.  Shows that an image doesn''t have to be complex and colorful to be a strong image.', '2011-09-07 10:11:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6531422, 970233, 83313, '<td valign="top">Glad to see Clark getting the opportunity to stretch his wheels! I''ve told <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=967241" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Celeste</a> about him. Perhaps someday she can meet him. You might think they were not compatible, but I bet they would hit it off nicely. (He does have a bike rack, doesn''t he?)</td>', 'Glad to see Clark getting the opportunity to stretch his wheels! I''ve told Celeste about him. Perhaps someday she can meet him. You might think they were not compatible, but I bet they would hit it off nicely. (He does have a bike rack, doesn''t he?)', '2011-09-07 10:11:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6531424, 969889, 59737, '<td valign="top">Very nice, makes me think of Southeast Asia.  Good coloring and processing, like the fading of the background into the sun.  Good range of light and shadows.</td>', 'Very nice, makes me think of Southeast Asia.  Good coloring and processing, like the fading of the background into the sun.  Good range of light and shadows.', '2011-09-07 10:13:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6531428, 970525, 59737, '<td valign="top">Looks like this could be from any period of time, nothing to really place it at least for me.  I like the leading lines and the contrast.</td>', 'Looks like this could be from any period of time, nothing to really place it at least for me.  I like the leading lines and the contrast.', '2011-09-07 10:16:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6531431, 969524, 59737, '<td valign="top">Like this, good processing and nice lighting here.  Very old fashioned look to the model, like the pearls and the pose.</td>', 'Like this, good processing and nice lighting here.  Very old fashioned look to the model, like the pearls and the pose.', '2011-09-07 10:21:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6531432, 969506, 59737, '<td valign="top">Very nice, like the IR, the old mill really works well with this, lots of little details, the fences reflections, just a nice image.</td>', 'Very nice, like the IR, the old mill really works well with this, lots of little details, the fences reflections, just a nice image.', '2011-09-07 10:25:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6531433, 970361, 83313, '<td valign="top">Grog is great hunter and provider for tribe. Bring home much mammoth meat this season. Grog is such great provider that Grog''s females get comfortable and lazy. Grog invent wheel, then Grog make even greater invention of bicycle, and send females out for exercise.<br/> <br/>Grog update comment: Females ride 2 laps around Starbucks and stop to talk. Grog gives up.</td>', 'Grog is great hunter and provider for tribe. Bring home much mammoth meat this season. Grog is such great provider that Grog''s females get comfortable and lazy. Grog invent wheel, then Grog make even greater invention of bicycle, and send females out for exercise. Grog update comment: Females ride 2 laps around Starbucks and stop to talk. Grog gives up.', '2011-09-07 10:25:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6531436, 970317, 59737, '<td valign="top">nice scene here, dramatic lighting in the sky, idyllic</td>', 'nice scene here, dramatic lighting in the sky, idyllic', '2011-09-07 10:32:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6531440, 968935, 59737, '<td valign="top">very cool, so much nothingness around them, get a feeling of remoteness and emptiness</td>', 'very cool, so much nothingness around them, get a feeling of remoteness and emptiness', '2011-09-07 10:39:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6531444, 969049, 59737, '<td valign="top">not sure about the border here, spending time looking at the changing colors of that rather than the image but it''s nicely done</td>', 'not sure about the border here, spending time looking at the changing colors of that rather than the image but it''s nicely done', '2011-09-07 10:41:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6531445, 969234, 59737, '<td valign="top">I like this, not exactly sure why I like it but it''s an attractive picture, she''s got a mysterious look to her and I like the pose with the cigarette.  Looks like it could have been from decades past.</td>', 'I like this, not exactly sure why I like it but it''s an attractive picture, she''s got a mysterious look to her and I like the pose with the cigarette.  Looks like it could have been from decades past.', '2011-09-07 10:43:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6531446, 969957, 59737, '<td valign="top">interesting framing, not a crop I would have thought of, it''s interesting and I like it.  Nice blend of colors sharpness and blur.</td>', 'interesting framing, not a crop I would have thought of, it''s interesting and I like it.  Nice blend of colors sharpness and blur.', '2011-09-07 10:44:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6531449, 970296, 59737, '<td valign="top">Good placement and framing of the wagon.  The processing doesn''t really work for me on this, maybe stressing the old nature with a more old fashioned processing (sepia and B+W)</td>', 'Good placement and framing of the wagon.  The processing doesn''t really work for me on this, maybe stressing the old nature with a more old fashioned processing (sepia and B+W)', '2011-09-07 10:47:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6531454, 969410, 59737, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t have enough tonal range for me, lots of grey without the highlights and deep shadows to make it pop a little.</td>', 'Doesn''t have enough tonal range for me, lots of grey without the highlights and deep shadows to make it pop a little.', '2011-09-07 10:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6531458, 967749, 59737, '<td valign="top">The walls really pull me into the picture right to the subject, like the squarish crop and centered child.  Good processing for this taking away any distractions there might have been.</td>', 'The walls really pull me into the picture right to the subject, like the squarish crop and centered child.  Good processing for this taking away any distractions there might have been.', '2011-09-07 10:50:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6531461, 970573, 119419, '<td valign="top">Amen</td>', 'Amen', '2011-09-07 10:52:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6531463, 970545, 119419, '<td valign="top">lovable ;)</td>', 'lovable ;)', '2011-09-07 10:53:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6531465, 970405, 119419, '<td valign="top">Nice artwork, truly</td>', 'Nice artwork, truly', '2011-09-07 10:53:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6531466, 969134, 59737, '<td valign="top">Wow is there a lot going on here, the blur makes me a little dizzy.  Nothing very specific to focus on but lots to look at</td>', 'Wow is there a lot going on here, the blur makes me a little dizzy.  Nothing very specific to focus on but lots to look at', '2011-09-07 10:54:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6531470, 970395, 59737, '<td valign="top">I think a tighter crop on this with less of the tree showing above their heads would make for a stronger composition.  Like the low key look</td>', 'I think a tighter crop on this with less of the tree showing above their heads would make for a stronger composition.  Like the low key look', '2011-09-07 10:56:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6531478, 966166, 59737, '<td valign="top">first word I thought of before even looking at the title was delicate, OK well that''s not quite true first word was WOW, then delicate.  Great use of a shallow depth of field with a strong focus on the one droplet.  Like the pink background as well.  Hope this does well for you.</td>', 'first word I thought of before even looking at the title was delicate, OK well that''s not quite true first word was WOW, then delicate.  Great use of a shallow depth of field with a strong focus on the one droplet.  Like the pink background as well.  Hope this does well for you.', '2011-09-07 10:58:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6531481, 970214, 59737, '<td valign="top">Really want to see more of the spider, the tight crop doesn''t work for me on this one.  Good DoF and focus with a pleasantly OoF backgound.</td>', 'Really want to see more of the spider, the tight crop doesn''t work for me on this one.  Good DoF and focus with a pleasantly OoF backgound.', '2011-09-07 10:59:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6531485, 970026, 59737, '<td valign="top">Seems ever so slightly out of perfectly straight but all the lines really accentuate that little bit out.  It is an interesting view and pretty abstract for what it is.</td>', 'Seems ever so slightly out of perfectly straight but all the lines really accentuate that little bit out.  It is an interesting view and pretty abstract for what it is.', '2011-09-07 11:01:16.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(6531487, 970398, 59737, '<td valign="top">Now that''s a pretty cool image, like the procssing and the colors, the smoke really works well with the sky and background clouds.</td>', 'Now that''s a pretty cool image, like the procssing and the colors, the smoke really works well with the sky and background clouds.', '2011-09-07 11:05:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6531489, 969435, 59737, '<td valign="top">Interesting image, gigantic stuffed animal, looks like she''s dreaming about something, looking at the picture I wonder what she''s thinking.</td>', 'Interesting image, gigantic stuffed animal, looks like she''s dreaming about something, looking at the picture I wonder what she''s thinking.', '2011-09-07 11:06:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6531492, 970450, 59737, '<td valign="top">beauty of a car there, the angle doesn''t work for me though.  Like the black and white conversion on this, lots of nice details to look at.</td>', 'beauty of a car there, the angle doesn''t work for me though.  Like the black and white conversion on this, lots of nice details to look at.', '2011-09-07 11:08:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6531504, 969542, 83313, '<td valign="top">Tribe of Grog hunt for long time and travel far from home. Grog find warning at cave entrance. <strike>Hiroglif</strike> <strike>hyro</strike> <strike>heiroglyf</strike> sign warns of terrible sharp-toothed beast within. Beast will eat tasty top parts (like brain and heart of Grog), but leave smelly lower parts for birds-who-eat-leftovers. Is not pleasant fate. But Grog is not afraid. Grog is grate fiter. Grog is brave. Grog is strong. Grog also smart. Grog send Thag into cave first.</td>', 'Tribe of Grog hunt for long time and travel far from home. Grog find warning at cave entrance. Hiroglif hyro heiroglyf sign warns of terrible sharp-toothed beast within. Beast will eat tasty top parts (like brain and heart of Grog), but leave smelly lower parts for birds-who-eat-leftovers. Is not pleasant fate. But Grog is not afraid. Grog is grate fiter. Grog is brave. Grog is strong. Grog also smart. Grog send Thag into cave first.', '2011-09-07 11:21:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6531543, 969904, 135937, '<td valign="top">The green in this is beautiful. Great color and composition! *8*</td>', 'The green in this is beautiful. Great color and composition! *8*', '2011-09-07 12:17:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6531546, 966298, 135937, '<td valign="top">This is great composition, and the bird makes me wonder what exactly he is looking at. =) The colors feel a little flat to me, not much depth, but other than that this is an adorable photograph. *6*</td>', 'This is great composition, and the bird makes me wonder what exactly he is looking at. =) The colors feel a little flat to me, not much depth, but other than that this is an adorable photograph. *6*', '2011-09-07 12:18:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6531550, 970417, 135937, '<td valign="top">Hehe, the looks on their faces are priceless. The balance in this photograph is wonderful, however it does feel flat and a little soft (It looks like your lens focused on the leaves just in front of the birds, rather than the birds themselves). It might benefit from a little post production. Brokeh and added shadow in the background might also have helped with the depth of field.<br/> <br/>I do really like the birds though. They''re cute! =)<br/> <br/>*6*</td>', 'Hehe, the looks on their faces are priceless. The balance in this photograph is wonderful, however it does feel flat and a little soft (It looks like your lens focused on the leaves just in front of the birds, rather than the birds themselves). It might benefit from a little post production. Brokeh and added shadow in the background might also have helped with the depth of field. I do really like the birds though. They''re cute! =) *6*', '2011-09-07 12:21:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6531552, 968935, 135937, '<td valign="top">How thrilling! Were you skiing with them? This is great. I almost wonder what it would have looked like in color though?</td>', 'How thrilling! Were you skiing with them? This is great. I almost wonder what it would have looked like in color though?', '2011-09-07 12:22:36.000000', NULL, 1),
