(6532129, 969953, 58634, '<td valign="top">In many aspects, this is fantastic. The lighting is great and you''ve got great color and contrast throughout the whole image. However, I find myself wondering what this would look like had you positioned yourself more to the left as to avoid the light post being almost dead center of the image?</td>', 'In many aspects, this is fantastic. The lighting is great and you''ve got great color and contrast throughout the whole image. However, I find myself wondering what this would look like had you positioned yourself more to the left as to avoid the light post being almost dead center of the image?', '2011-09-07 20:50:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6532132, 969536, 58634, '<td valign="top">lovely textures on this bridge/pier.</td>', 'lovely textures on this bridge/pier.', '2011-09-07 20:51:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6532136, 966166, 58634, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=43463" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">CNovack</a>''s "Ethereal"  <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=965031" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1430/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_965031.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1430/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_965031.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1430/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_965031.jpg"/></a>although much paler. I like the shallow depth of field that focuses only on the droplet/s.</td>', 'Reminds me of  CNovack''s "Ethereal"  although much paler. I like the shallow depth of field that focuses only on the droplet/s.', '2011-09-07 20:53:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6532140, 970294, 58634, '<td valign="top">I like the contrasting colors between the sky and the different elements. The contrast is very beautiful.</td>', 'I like the contrasting colors between the sky and the different elements. The contrast is very beautiful.', '2011-09-07 20:54:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6532141, 969730, 58634, '<td valign="top">Silly little fella''. He almost looks evil! I like the right up-front view.</td>', 'Silly little fella''. He almost looks evil! I like the right up-front view.', '2011-09-07 20:54:31.000000', NULL, 1),
