(6532152, 970321, 76335, '<td valign="top">Beautifully composed. Everything about the occasion fills the frame to the brim.</td>', 'Beautifully composed. Everything about the occasion fills the frame to the brim.', '2011-09-07 20:59:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6532156, 970452, 76335, '<td valign="top">Telling of his trials, but upbeat portrait at the same time. Nice.</td>', 'Telling of his trials, but upbeat portrait at the same time. Nice.', '2011-09-07 20:59:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6532157, 970560, 76335, '<td valign="top">A wonderful portrait. I''m most struck by the light/dark contrast in the background.</td>', 'A wonderful portrait. I''m most struck by the light/dark contrast in the background.', '2011-09-07 20:59:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6532158, 970454, 76335, '<td valign="top">This is alive with nightlife energy. Well done. Looking forward to #2.</td>', 'This is alive with nightlife energy. Well done. Looking forward to #2.', '2011-09-07 20:59:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6532162, 966503, 76335, '<td valign="top">I like the tilt and high contrast sepia. Almost feels haunted.</td>', 'I like the tilt and high contrast sepia. Almost feels haunted.', '2011-09-07 21:00:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6532163, 970519, 76335, '<td valign="top">Wonderful energy and harmony here.</td>', 'Wonderful energy and harmony here.', '2011-09-07 21:00:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6532165, 970217, 76335, '<td valign="top">I like how he creeps into the frame. Intrepid. Hungry. (I might have guessed coyote though.)</td>', 'I like how he creeps into the frame. Intrepid. Hungry. (I might have guessed coyote though.)', '2011-09-07 21:00:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6532169, 969368, 76335, '<td valign="top">Lucky to have this vantage point. As such, the overhead look can often score on its novelty alone. But you''ve taken this a step further and given some thought to composition. Very nice.</td>', 'Lucky to have this vantage point. As such, the overhead look can often score on its novelty alone. But you''ve taken this a step further and given some thought to composition. Very nice.', '2011-09-07 21:00:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6532171, 970508, 76335, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. Like an early American painting. Love the cool tones, softness.</td>', 'Beautiful. Like an early American painting. Love the cool tones, softness.', '2011-09-07 21:00:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6532172, 968544, 76335, '<td valign="top">What wonderful friends have you! Incredible. Looks like it''s going to be a pretty bad day.</td>', 'What wonderful friends have you! Incredible. Looks like it''s going to be a pretty bad day.', '2011-09-07 21:00:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6532175, 969750, 76335, '<td valign="top">I can feel the dryness -- like it''s about to peel and flake from my screen. Nice work.</td>', 'I can feel the dryness -- like it''s about to peel and flake from my screen. Nice work.', '2011-09-07 21:01:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6532176, 970391, 76335, '<td valign="top">A strange interaction for sure. I don''t know if I feel tension or love.</td>', 'A strange interaction for sure. I don''t know if I feel tension or love.', '2011-09-07 21:01:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6532177, 968266, 76335, '<td valign="top">Mars is tranquil like this, I suppose... Intriguing.</td>', 'Mars is tranquil like this, I suppose... Intriguing.', '2011-09-07 21:01:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6532180, 969446, 131284, '<td valign="top">A lensbaby I presume? Anyway, there are elements to this image I like but I just wish there was some discernible focal point. With nowhere for my eyes to rest I find it hard to stare for too long. Perhaps if the focus was on either the girl on the pavement or the guy in the window it would have worked better for me.</td>', 'A lensbaby I presume? Anyway, there are elements to this image I like but I just wish there was some discernible focal point. With nowhere for my eyes to rest I find it hard to stare for too long. Perhaps if the focus was on either the girl on the pavement or the guy in the window it would have worked better for me.', '2011-09-07 21:02:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6532181, 969136, 76335, '<td valign="top">Well, what''s not to like here. Quirky and fun. Like childhood.</td>', 'Well, what''s not to like here. Quirky and fun. Like childhood.', '2011-09-07 21:02:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6532183, 970565, 76335, '<td valign="top">I''m a sucker for haphazard architecture. So happy you didn''t center the door to the frame. This is excellent.</td>', 'I''m a sucker for haphazard architecture. So happy you didn''t center the door to the frame. This is excellent.', '2011-09-07 21:02:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6532184, 969318, 76335, '<td valign="top">Beautifully done. The low key presentation, ironically, makes it that much more revealing.</td>', 'Beautifully done. The low key presentation, ironically, makes it that much more revealing.', '2011-09-07 21:02:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6532185, 968817, 76335, '<td valign="top">Outstanding tableau.</td>', 'Outstanding tableau.', '2011-09-07 21:03:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6532186, 965004, 76335, '<td valign="top">That old barn feels even more feeble in that it seems to be delicately balanced on the crack/shadow in the road. A smart compositional touch. Excellent.</td>', 'That old barn feels even more feeble in that it seems to be delicately balanced on the crack/shadow in the road. A smart compositional touch. Excellent.', '2011-09-07 21:03:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6532187, 970418, 76335, '<td valign="top">Wonderful gravity, tension.</td>', 'Wonderful gravity, tension.', '2011-09-07 21:03:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6532188, 969410, 76335, '<td valign="top">I really like the soft contrast here. Glad you didn''t try to crank up the volume on this one, as it would have disturbed the quietness that you so wonderfully captured.</td>', 'I really like the soft contrast here. Glad you didn''t try to crank up the volume on this one, as it would have disturbed the quietness that you so wonderfully captured.', '2011-09-07 21:03:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6532189, 970069, 76335, '<td valign="top">Usually I''m not a fan of stylized street (or candid) photography, but this is tastefully done, adds atmosphere, mystery, and holds up well.</td>', 'Usually I''m not a fan of stylized street (or candid) photography, but this is tastefully done, adds atmosphere, mystery, and holds up well.', '2011-09-07 21:03:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6532190, 970413, 76335, '<td valign="top">I like how the tree seems to be holding an awkward dance pose. The tractor provides balance.</td>', 'I like how the tree seems to be holding an awkward dance pose. The tractor provides balance.', '2011-09-07 21:03:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6532191, 969692, 76335, '<td valign="top">Beautifully unsettling, if such a thing is possible.</td>', 'Beautifully unsettling, if such a thing is possible.', '2011-09-07 21:03:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6532192, 969312, 76335, '<td valign="top">An antilandscape. Cold and uninviting. I like it.</td>', 'An antilandscape. Cold and uninviting. I like it.', '2011-09-07 21:03:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6532194, 969730, 86799, '<td valign="top">Excellent, majestic portrait.  The highlights are key, and give great depth and detail.  And the matter-of-fact-I-am-impressive expression is intriguing.  Nicely done.</td>', 'Excellent, majestic portrait.  The highlights are key, and give great depth and detail.  And the matter-of-fact-I-am-impressive expression is intriguing.  Nicely done.', '2011-09-07 21:04:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6532196, 969957, 86799, '<td valign="top">Smooth, flowing, intriguing.  Love this.  Passion flower is so different, but this is even a unique view.  Well done.</td>', 'Smooth, flowing, intriguing.  Love this.  Passion flower is so different, but this is even a unique view.  Well done.', '2011-09-07 21:05:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6532200, 970538, 86799, '<td valign="top">Just a little too high-key on the model...not bad, just slightly bright.</td>', 'Just a little too high-key on the model...not bad, just slightly bright.', '2011-09-07 21:07:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6532203, 970369, 86799, '<td valign="top">Smooth, flowing, sensuous.  Sharp.  Excellent placement and point of view.  Good stuff.</td>', 'Smooth, flowing, sensuous.  Sharp.  Excellent placement and point of view.  Good stuff.', '2011-09-07 21:09:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6532206, 969368, 86799, '<td valign="top">Unique point of view, interesting texture.</td>', 'Unique point of view, interesting texture.', '2011-09-07 21:11:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6532209, 969881, 86799, '<td valign="top">The dogs of doom are howling low...</td>', 'The dogs of doom are howling low...', '2011-09-07 21:12:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6532237, 970418, 131284, '<td valign="top">Hmm, this is an odd one - there are images I rate higher in this free study but none of them I wish to favourite (which I have done with this), there''s just something about the image that makes me want to stare at it, perhaps a sense that there is something truly spectacular happening just off of camera and staring long enough will reveal what that is.<br/> <br/>Or perhaps it''s something more subtle in the composition that makes this so appealing to me such as the movement leading out of frame both left and right: the man arching his back to the right of frame, the pillar in the middle leaning slightly to the right, the beams of light on the back wall moving rightward across the frame, one directing focus towards and hitting the man''s face, and the left hand sign giving rightward movement with how it moves in to the centre of the frame. All countered by the left-leaning reflections, the sign gesturing to the left, and and man''s gaze leading to the left out of frame.<br/> <br/>Whatever the reason, it''s a great photo. My only complaint is that the man being <u>very</u> slightly soft (or out of focus) is driving me slightly mad =). 8</td>', 'Hmm, this is an odd one - there are images I rate higher in this free study but none of them I wish to favourite (which I have done with this), there''s just something about the image that makes me want to stare at it, perhaps a sense that there is something truly spectacular happening just off of camera and staring long enough will reveal what that is. Or perhaps it''s something more subtle in the composition that makes this so appealing to me such as the movement leading out of frame both left and right: the man arching his back to the right of frame, the pillar in the middle leaning slightly to the right, the beams of light on the back wall moving rightward across the frame, one directing focus towards and hitting the man''s face, and the left hand sign giving rightward movement with how it moves in to the centre of the frame. All countered by the left-leaning reflections, the sign gesturing to the left, and and man''s gaze leading to the left out of frame. Whatever the reason, it''s a great photo. My only complaint is that the man being very slightly soft (or out of focus) is driving me slightly mad =). 8', '2011-09-07 21:30:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6532241, 969650, 131284, '<td valign="top">Nice dof, backdrop and framing. I know a lot of photographers in shots like this would probably clone out the stray hair strands, but I think they work quite well with the action of the model here. 7</td>', 'Nice dof, backdrop and framing. I know a lot of photographers in shots like this would probably clone out the stray hair strands, but I think they work quite well with the action of the model here. 7', '2011-09-07 21:31:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6532242, 970165, 131284, '<td valign="top">Hah, if this isn''t <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=53147" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">timfythetoo</a>''s entry I think someone needs to let him know about this place! Anyway, nice photo/framing. Now I just wonder what the inside of that shop looks like =).</td>', 'Hah, if this isn''t  timfythetoo''s entry I think someone needs to let him know about this place! Anyway, nice photo/framing. Now I just wonder what the inside of that shop looks like =).', '2011-09-07 21:31:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6532243, 970118, 131284, '<td valign="top">Hmm, this reminds me very much of this image <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=964673" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1415/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_964673.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1415/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_964673.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1415/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_964673.jpg"/></a>... I wonder if it''s the same photographer?<br/> <br/>Anyway, my feelings about this are very similar too; the location''s nice as is the framing with the blades of the windmill just off touching the top right corner of the frame. Also the expression/glance of all the sheep is priceless - all in all a nice image. My only gripes are that the saturation is ever so slightly too much for me (not enough to spoil the image and of course this is down to taste), and it''s also unfortunate the image is slightly soft, though perhaps this is down to the equipment used? Anyway, this gets a 7 from me.</td>', 'Hmm, this reminds me very much of this image ... I wonder if it''s the same photographer? Anyway, my feelings about this are very similar too; the location''s nice as is the framing with the blades of the windmill just off touching the top right corner of the frame. Also the expression/glance of all the sheep is priceless - all in all a nice image. My only gripes are that the saturation is ever so slightly too much for me (not enough to spoil the image and of course this is down to taste), and it''s also unfortunate the image is slightly soft, though perhaps this is down to the equipment used? Anyway, this gets a 7 from me.', '2011-09-07 21:31:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6532245, 969368, 131284, '<td valign="top">Ah, your kite photography in action <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=16266" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">leaf</a>... I actually preferred some of the other shots you did that were slightly higher up, but still this nice =).<br/> <br/>Hope you haven''t broken your camera from this yet!</td>', 'Ah, your kite photography in action  leaf... I actually preferred some of the other shots you did that were slightly higher up, but still this nice =). Hope you haven''t broken your camera from this yet!', '2011-09-07 21:32:10.000000', NULL, 1),
