(6532308, 970025, 85430, '<td valign="top">Nice warm colors</td>', 'Nice warm colors', '2011-09-07 22:28:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6532309, 968817, 135937, '<td valign="top">Upon first glance, I was just going to vote semi-low on this and pass over it, but I stopped myself. The longer I look at this, the more questions it presents. I almost wonder if this might have an even greater impact if it were converted to a filtered B&amp;W. It also might benefit from a crop placing only the four individuals nearest to the statue in the frame. <br/> <br/>I actually really like the potential in this street shot. *6*</td>', 'Upon first glance, I was just going to vote semi-low on this and pass over it, but I stopped myself. The longer I look at this, the more questions it presents. I almost wonder if this might have an even greater impact if it were converted to a filtered B&W. It also might benefit from a crop placing only the four individuals nearest to the statue in the frame.  I actually really like the potential in this street shot. *6*', '2011-09-07 22:29:16.000000', NULL, 1),
