(6532844, 970567, 69008, '<td valign="top">They liked the strong colors!  Good shooting there Kris.  You were lucky to get close enough to get this one with your 50mm.  This is a Gulf Fliterary butterfly. They look completely different on top. I think that this is the same butterfly, same place and time. <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=972109" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/65000-69999/69008/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_972109.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/65000-69999/69008/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_972109.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/65000-69999/69008/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_972109.jpg"/></a> <br/></td>', 'They liked the strong colors!  Good shooting there Kris.  You were lucky to get close enough to get this one with your 50mm.  This is a Gulf Fliterary butterfly. They look completely different on top. I think that this is the same butterfly, same place and time.  ', '2011-09-08 02:04:49.000000', NULL, 0),
