(6533165, 966262, 77196, '<td valign="top">Very, very nice. Love the colors and the feel of motion. The black background makes it pop, and the angle just adds to the feel. But, for me, the hand position just completes the shot - it nicely extends the lines and make a logic "stopping spot" for your eyes, increasing the sense of motion with the anticipation of more to come. More what is not clear, but I think that enhances the emotion.</td>', 'Very, very nice. Love the colors and the feel of motion. The black background makes it pop, and the angle just adds to the feel. But, for me, the hand position just completes the shot - it nicely extends the lines and make a logic "stopping spot" for your eyes, increasing the sense of motion with the anticipation of more to come. More what is not clear, but I think that enhances the emotion.', '2011-09-08 10:03:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(6533175, 970005, 77196, '<td valign="top">I like the juxtaposition of the in-focus foreground with the cycle rider in the background. The curved piece makes a nice leading line to the rider. I''m not sure there is enough of interest in the foreground - my eye kind-of skips directly to the end of the word VELOCE. Very nice contrast in this piece, but maybe a tad dark overall. Great eye, and very nice capture.</td>', 'I like the juxtaposition of the in-focus foreground with the cycle rider in the background. The curved piece makes a nice leading line to the rider. I''m not sure there is enough of interest in the foreground - my eye kind-of skips directly to the end of the word VELOCE. Very nice contrast in this piece, but maybe a tad dark overall. Great eye, and very nice capture.', '2011-09-08 10:18:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(6533180, 968544, 113156, '<td valign="top">I really enjoyed your story, a huge congrats on your win with this enormous effort, you totally deserve it.</td>', 'I really enjoyed your story, a huge congrats on your win with this enormous effort, you totally deserve it.', '2011-09-08 10:24:44.000000', NULL, 0),
