(6533205, 969487, 108580, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot Ammie. I think it''s very extraordinary! <br/>I took 1 a few days ago, thanks to the grass fires making everything orange up north Limpopo way. Just the hills though, no trees.<br/>To me this is as appealing as a Konrad or Philip seascape shot of Kogel Bay.<br/><a href="//www.flickr.com/photos/magnum_za/6126641671/in/photostream" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//farm7.static.flickr.com/6086/6126641671_df59a8fc35_s.jpg'', strrpos(''//farm7.static.flickr.com/6086/6126641671_df59a8fc35_s.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//farm7.static.flickr.com/6086/6126641671_df59a8fc35_s.jpg"/></a></td>', 'Lovely shot Ammie. I think it''s very extraordinary! I took 1 a few days ago, thanks to the grass fires making everything orange up north Limpopo way. Just the hills though, no trees.To me this is as appealing as a Konrad or Philip seascape shot of Kogel Bay.', '2011-09-08 11:05:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(6533208, 970293, 108580, '<td valign="top">Moody shot Herman. Pity the shoe was chopped off. Posthumous territory?</td>', 'Moody shot Herman. Pity the shoe was chopped off. Posthumous territory?', '2011-09-08 11:14:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(6533209, 969203, 51269, '<td valign="top">WOW- Denise- this is fabulous !!! Congrats on placing right up there in this huge pack :-D.<br/>(at first i thought the title said "private" LOL )</td>', 'WOW- Denise- this is fabulous !!! Congrats on placing right up there in this huge pack :-D.(at first i thought the title said "private" LOL )', '2011-09-08 11:19:28.000000', NULL, 0),
