(6533229, 970407, 92577, '<td valign="top">Very striking image. Congrats on top twenty finish. Hey, I''m going to Corfu next June to shoot a family wedding. I can just imagine the bride and groom on that beach! (Will you PM me with the location in case it''s nearby?)</td>', 'Very striking image. Congrats on top twenty finish. Hey, I''m going to Corfu next June to shoot a family wedding. I can just imagine the bride and groom on that beach! (Will you PM me with the location in case it''s nearby?)', '2011-09-08 11:35:43.000000', NULL, 0),
