(6533236, 967836, 35545, '<td valign="top">The mosaic floor makes a nice frame for the bikes.  HDR works well here.  Love the composition and ambiance.</td>', 'The mosaic floor makes a nice frame for the bikes.  HDR works well here.  Love the composition and ambiance.', '2011-09-08 11:40:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(6533237, 968866, 136989, '<td valign="top">Thanks everyone for pointing out the issues with the shadows.  I went to a friends and viewed the pic on another monitor and it looks totally different than how I see it on mine.  Looks like I need to double check some stuff.</td>', 'Thanks everyone for pointing out the issues with the shadows.  I went to a friends and viewed the pic on another monitor and it looks totally different than how I see it on mine.  Looks like I need to double check some stuff.', '2011-09-08 11:42:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(6533239, 968544, 112739, '<td valign="top">Really well done Alex. I love the story behind the photo. Helps to appreciate the effort that goes into making a shot like this. Winning a FS is incredibly difficult! There are so many good things about the image,it deserved to win for sure!</td>', 'Really well done Alex. I love the story behind the photo. Helps to appreciate the effort that goes into making a shot like this. Winning a FS is incredibly difficult! There are so many good things about the image,it deserved to win for sure!', '2011-09-08 11:43:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(6533241, 970348, 92577, '<td valign="top">thought this was really great</td>', 'thought this was really great', '2011-09-08 11:44:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(6533247, 970321, 3585, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, happy scene; always a complicated exercise.</td>', 'Nice shot, happy scene; always a complicated exercise.', '2011-09-08 12:04:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(6533248, 969542, 67697, '<td valign="top">I''m just in awe of your ability to find garbage and turn it into art.  Almost got a brown for it too!  At least you are in the gallery :D</td>', 'I''m just in awe of your ability to find garbage and turn it into art.  Almost got a brown for it too!  At least you are in the gallery :D', '2011-09-08 12:04:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(6533251, 970407, 67697, '<td valign="top">Tome - such beautiful moodiness in this shot.  Is that you then on the platform?  So smart - showing the art of beach at night.  Love it.</td>', 'Tome - such beautiful moodiness in this shot.  Is that you then on the platform?  So smart - showing the art of beach at night.  Love it.', '2011-09-08 12:06:56.000000', NULL, 0),
