(6533367, 970092, 20799, '<td valign="top">Fantastic light - and lightning! I''m guessing the lightning provided most of the light on the scene, while the other part of 12 seconds it was too dark and the camera shake isn''t too visible... Handheld natural flash photography? :).<br/>Congrats on the top 10, stunning image! Like Ursula, I love the visible shake on the green light.</td>', 'Fantastic light - and lightning! I''m guessing the lightning provided most of the light on the scene, while the other part of 12 seconds it was too dark and the camera shake isn''t too visible... Handheld natural flash photography? :).Congrats on the top 10, stunning image! Like Ursula, I love the visible shake on the green light.', '2011-09-08 14:48:42.000000', NULL, 0),
