(6538311, 969609, 12611, '<td valign="top">This is a really nice shot that was underrated and under-commented ass well. Beautiful pastoral impressionist feel. I guess the pile of stuff in the foreground just isn''t very pretty, but I like the total feel of the shot. I guess that is the problem with photography vs. painting, if you were painting this scene- yopu would certainly not include the big pile, but alas, such is life.</td>', 'This is a really nice shot that was underrated and under-commented ass well. Beautiful pastoral impressionist feel. I guess the pile of stuff in the foreground just isn''t very pretty, but I like the total feel of the shot. I guess that is the problem with photography vs. painting, if you were painting this scene- yopu would certainly not include the big pile, but alas, such is life.', '2011-09-13 09:27:39.000000', NULL, 0),
